{"id":"1276beba-a448-4757-af40-2b425ab9aed8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"d23edde537d598ff","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e7ffc9c40865f77c955db28af6ed903aff4194d8","start":2640,"end":2995},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","function","isTestFile","(","path",":","string",")",":","boolean","{","const","parts","=","path",".","split","(","\"","/","\"",")",";","const","name","=","parts",".","at","(","-","1",")","??","\"","","\"",";","if","(","!","/","\\.[cm]?[jt]s$","/","u",".","test","(","name",")","||","parts",".","some","(","(","part",")","=>","part","===","\"","node_modules","\"","||","part",".","startsWith","(","\"",".","\"",")",")",")","{","return","false",";","}","return","/","(?:^test\\.|^test-|[.\\-_]test\\.[cm]?[jt]s$)","/","u",".","test","(","name",")","||","parts",".","slice","(","0",",","-","1",")",".","includes","(","\"","test","\"",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"11da055ba9b014ab","after":"55faaa87590b7732"}},"payload":{"text":"What `node --test` with no files runs, as node finds them: `*.test.*`, `*-test.*`, `*_test.*`, `test-*` and\n`test.*` files, and every file in a `test` folder — scripts only, never under node_modules or a dot folder.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:07.582Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:07.582Z"}
{"id":"235dce29-dc1a-48da-ad6a-f46a6a70980b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7e1c36a5e3f2ba5b#0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"13f3ff9706da9d58dd92a61cedb275f185a39076","start":9565,"end":9575},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["run",".","end","(","1",")"]},"context":{"before":"7d4b80559a5b4d88","after":"149707c400e6ee9e"}},"payload":{"text":"The debugger couldn't take it: say so, loudly — no plain-runtime fallback (RUNNING.md, *What can't run this\nway*: a gap is a bug to fix, not a second way to run).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:41.521Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:41.521Z"}
{"id":"38a6a15a-da80-45c4-83c7-e5962eda5341","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"162f0cf43f804bd0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e0354a42bb0af67781c9220d002e8d40f182a647","start":7824,"end":7889},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","source","=","await","ctx",".","fs",".","readFile","(","file",")",".","catch","(","(",")","=>","undefined",")"]},"context":{"before":"5cfaa3400dfb9271","after":"cc2ba7fa575a253e"}},"payload":{"text":"Service or task, by what its source does (lifecycle.ts) — a label for the running list, not how it runs: every run\nis the debugger's, and one that listens becomes a service. An unreadable file is left to fail as a task.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:48.572Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:48.572Z"}
{"id":"4e0cb659-2c4e-4a8a-aa21-6bda8d41dfd6","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7a19482ea26147dd","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"922af76610334a09afb4fbcf67340d9d16564099","start":4888,"end":5426},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","\"","tests","\"","in","invocation",")","{","const","files","=","invocation",".","tests",".","length",">","0","?","invocation",".","tests",":","await","testFilesUnder","(","ctx",".","cwd",")",";","if","(","files",".","length","===","0",")","{","return","{","\"","stdout","\"",":","\"","","\"",",","\"","stderr","\"",":","`","node: no test files under ","${","ctx",".","cwd","}","\\","\\n","n","`",",","\"","exitCode","\"",":","1","}",";","}","let","exitCode","=","0",";","for","(","const","file","of","files",")","{","output","(","\"","out","\"",",","`","▶ ","${","file","}","\\","\\n","n","`",")",";","const","ran","=","await","runFile","(","file",",","[","]",",","`","node --test ","${","file","}","","`",")",";","exitCode","||=","ran",".","exitCode",";","if","(","ctx",".","signal","?.","aborted","===","true",")","{","break",";","}","}","return","result","(","exitCode",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"bda6e501ba0b657b","after":"399656482fcde30c"}},"payload":{"text":"Test files, one after another, each a run of its own; failed if any failed, as node --test is.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:00.541Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:00.541Z"}
{"id":"52d120db-e852-4e14-b328-2c9235bfe475","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"5eae62231bf513fb","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"54cd88c6702fac8a433c30324ab87d30fb55ed9b","start":8249,"end":8343},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","event","=","Object",".","fromEntries","(","ctx",".","env",")","[","\"","npm_lifecycle_event","\"","]","??","env","[","\"","npm_lifecycle_event","\"","]"]},"context":{"before":"26397fb507d30e9d","after":"b58bfb3308793adb"}},"payload":{"text":"In the running list as it was asked for (`npm run build` runs `node build.ts`). (`npm run` passes the script's\nname in the environment it runs it with — ctx.env, not the exported one.)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:46.273Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:46.273Z"}
{"id":"5935526b-371d-4d79-bbde-1b821a447f8f","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"32364b15fc4915cc","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"29a2e4c952d4b71a4fd13c5cfe6f3b4aefdbcb92","start":9086,"end":9258},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","debugged","=","await","runner",".","debug","(","file",",","ctx",".","cwd",",","env",",","{","\"","runId","\"",":","run",".","id",",","\"","onOutput","\"",":","output",",","\"","signal","\"",":","controller",".","signal",",","\"","args","\"",":","programArgs",",","\"","onListening","\"",":","listening","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"a3b618f11acb28d0#1","after":"7d4b80559a5b4d88"}},"payload":{"text":"In the debugger, as every Run is — breakpoints, step-back, capability stops — its output here, its stdin from\nhere, the arguments after the file. (`npm run dev` → `vite` is a separate command, the dev server's.)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:43.848Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:43.848Z"}
{"id":"6c5af961-de05-4eb1-94e1-2fc766b9e361","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7e1c36a5e3f2ba5b#1","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4482ac7b3877b51d846a66991be39cb61097f159","start":9855,"end":9865},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["run",".","end","(","1",")"]},"context":{"before":"c49d74eeff529f8a#0","after":"9f881f95f760ad3d"}},"payload":{"text":"The worker unreachable — surface it rather than hanging the shell.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:39.161Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:39.161Z"}
{"id":"8af5b467-6a13-4b45-aaf6-7e031235ff3c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"c714a4cbee2d25d7","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"15ba7e4db8a6fd9c03510f21c789fc074c5538ed","start":4220,"end":4262},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","collected","=","{","\"","out","\"",":","\"","","\"",",","\"","err","\"",":","\"","","\"","}"]},"context":{"before":"a93919b4effee887","after":"c5f12bde4758e867"}},"payload":{"text":"(into a pipe or a file — `node x 2>&1 | tail` — its output is collected and handed back through the shell; to the\nterminal, written live)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:02.944Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:02.944Z"}
{"id":"c9905d89-d078-4a10-a85e-32a885f3c83e","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3473f972d3a89f08","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9894f1365492d3fcf2d53da6756903f69e7bf0df","start":1628,"end":1679},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","EVAL_DIR","=","\"","/workspace/.silo/local/node-eval","\""]},"context":{"before":"b55475583bca3216","after":"11da055ba9b014ab"}},"payload":{"text":"The `node <file>` command: resolve the script against cwd and run it in the node worker, STREAMING its output\nstraight to the terminal (`writeLive`) as it's produced rather than buffering it into the returned stdout —\nso a long-running or interactive process shows output live. It therefore returns empty stdout (already\nwritten); a consequence is that a streamed `node …` doesn't feed a shell pipe/redirect. `ctx.signal` is the\nshell's Ctrl-C, forwarded to the runner so the worker is killed.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:14.554Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:14.554Z"}
{"id":"cce1aade-4cd3-4c80-a5bb-9f2e61fad56b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"399656482fcde30c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"ceee581aaa2a7f257e976c28e4a0db2a0312013a","start":5530,"end":5561},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["let","scratch",":","string","|","undefined"]},"context":{"before":"7a19482ea26147dd","after":"ed67293e1b095e48"}},"payload":{"text":"Code runs from a file of its own, removed once it's run.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:56.017Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:56.017Z"}
{"id":"d1c03baa-ef99-4a80-99ea-fdf419274c6d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"22d1c211aabb834c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"87b1f4bf827335065e267815ebc7652d28527df4","start":7440,"end":7480},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","controller","=","new","AbortController","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"0f961aa9cde9ff87","after":"5cfaa3400dfb9271"}},"payload":{"text":"One way to stop it, whoever asks: the shell's Ctrl-C (or the terminal closing), the running list, the debug Stop.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:50.849Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:04:50.849Z"}
{"id":"d706030e-b0b1-47e9-9c41-25bd4c31f605","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3473f972d3a89f08","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"7c04cc9158a05580ef269b901927cba58b3b4a84","start":2145,"end":2196},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","EVAL_DIR","=","\"","/workspace/.silo/local/node-eval","\""]},"context":{"before":"b55475583bca3216","after":"11da055ba9b014ab"}},"payload":{"text":"Where `-e` / `-p` code is run from: silo's machine-local folder, out of git (and out of the way).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:12.096Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:12.096Z"}
{"id":"e33b3f2e-cb82-4524-ab6e-23284c661cd5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ab099c339bf2d1aa","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"f6b53f48e79badc62bcfc877fa360adf892b5b19","start":0,"end":53},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Juvy","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/util/juvy","\""]},"context":{"after":"0fe3726b1ac55994"}},"payload":{"text":"The terminal's `node` command — a thin just-bash custom command that resolves the target script against the shell's\ncwd and runs it as every Run does (RUNNING.md, *Output goes where it was started*): in the debugger, its output and\nstdin this terminal, with the command line's arguments, the shell's directory and its environment. just-bash owns the\nshell. When the debugger can't take it, it says so and fails (exit 1) — there's no plain-runtime fallback.\n\nNode's other forms, as people type them: `-e <code>` runs the code and `-p <expression>` prints it (the debugger\nruns files, so the code goes in one under `.silo/local/`, which stays out of git, removed after); `-v` asks the runtime\nitself (`-p process.version`); `--test` runs test files, each in the debugger (node:test is the editor's: RUNNING.md,\n*Tests*); and a bare `node` (a REPL) says it isn't here yet rather than misbehave.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:19.124Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:19.124Z"}
{"id":"ea4e4e3e-9528-4bc9-90ee-a7b9777be4ea","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7ef8e1701bdcd772","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/node/node.ts","baseline":{"blob":"98a72a04dc25c7e2607fd0fa694d9565a2f5b870","start":3765,"end":3905},"shape":{"type":"Return","atoms":["return","{","\"","unsupported","\"",":","\"","node: there's no REPL here yet — `node -e` runs a line of code, `node` with a file runs a program","\"",",","\"","exitCode","\"",":","0","}"]},"context":{"before":"990e91a7b63e8157","after":"80fad1557d6a29a3"}},"payload":{"text":"(Asking for nothing failed — there's just no REPL — so it isn't an error.)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:05.305Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:05:05.305Z"}
